import lib/std.dl

function grouped value:
    before: $ + $, $ - $, $ * $, $ / $, set $ to $
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("return", value)

class:
    patterns:
        [a|] box
    members:
        yaw
        turning

a box facing {integer:yaw} and turning by {integer:turning} means: @intrinsic("construct", a box, yaw, turning)

set view to a box facing 1 and turning by 2
add view's turning to view's yaw
print line view's yaw
